{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_family

    The page of a family, theirs, from the link they got. The heading is the name the family uses at home, written by
    hand, as on the label of the backpack on its hook; with the living hall, the hall goes beside it on a wide screen,
    as a window, and above it on a phone. Under the heading, one thing of now (familypage::arrange(), drawn by
    public_thing): their visit in the band of the centre's colour, with the calendar; once they came, how to ask for a
    place, in the same band; whether each child goes on next school year while some is not answered; «How did it go?»;
    a birthday; the story of the first day; the one open question… The rest goes under «Also on your page», each in a
    line that says what it is and how it stands, and opens where it is. Then the people who will receive them, with
    their face, when the centre says who; and what they told us, with their data, folded, to take or to erase. Once a
    child is enrolled, «That is it» and who carries them from now on (a person with their face, or a place on the colour
    of the centre), how the centre writes to them and the thanks of whoever received them, under the heading.

    Example context (json):
